330
00:23:16,166 --> 00:23:20,070
A meteorite drifting
through the infinite cosmos.

331
00:23:20,504 --> 00:23:23,367
One day, with a one-in-a-billion chance,
it lands on Earth.

332
00:23:23,392 --> 00:23:24,320
Boom.

333
00:23:24,812 --> 00:23:26,166
Right here.

334
00:23:26,166 --> 00:23:27,500
A direct hit.

335
00:23:27,791 --> 00:23:29,687
