I've already sensed

575
00:38:14,458 --> 00:38:15,833
that you're going to leave.

576
00:38:21,917 --> 00:38:22,708
Lei Zexin.

577
00:38:23,667 --> 00:38:24,917
As long as you don't leave,

578
00:38:25,125 --> 00:38:26,708
we'll be together forever.

579
00:38:32,738 --> 00:38:34,988
I really wish time could stop at this day.

580
00:38:35,917 --> 00:38:36,917
That way,

581
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:40,083
we'd never have to be apart.

582
00:38:40,869 --> 00:38:43,252
What the grasslands have most of is time.

583
00:38:43,864 --> 00:38:45,823
I can take you to do so many things.

584
00:38:46,333 --> 00:38:47,500
Go horseback riding,

585
00:38:48,167 --> 00:38:49,083
herd sheep

586
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:52,250
and we can visit Mongke's farm.

587
00:38:53,503 --> 00:38:54,794
There's so much to do.

588
00:38:55,292 --> 00:38:56,458
How could one day be enough?

589
00:38:58,270 --> 00:38:59,104
Amur.

590
00:39:00,292 --> 00:39:01,583
There's something

591
00:39:02,208 --> 00:39:03,542
I want to tell you.

592
00:39:05,406 --> 00:39:06,606
Tell me.

593
00:39:09,766 --> 00:39:10,926
Actually

594
00:39:11,750 --> 00:39:13,000
I've met Xiaohei.

595
00:39:29,739 --> 00:39:30,864
I knew it.

596
00:39:32,986 --> 00:39:34,486
After all this time,

597
00:39:37,535 --> 00:39:38,994
he's not coming back.

598
00:39:58,332 --> 00:40:00,371
(Xiaohei)

599
00:40:18,773 --> 00:40:21,440
Tell me, what happened to Xiaohei?

600
00:40:24,333 --> 00:40:25,167
Amur.

601
00:40:25,625 --> 00:40:27,667
I never intended to deceive you.

602
00:40:28,125 --> 00:40:29,375
It's just...

603
00:40:29,862 --> 00:40:31,945
I never knew how to tell you.

604
00:40:34,750 --> 00:40:35,667
So

605
00:40:37,245 --> 00:40:39,495
you mean it wasn't a wolf that bit you,

606
00:40:41,375 --> 00:40:42,667
it was Xiaohei, wasn't it?

607
00:40:43,167 --> 00:40:46,083
Amur, is that what you think?

608
00:40:46,108 --> 00:40:48,483
What kind of misunderstanding happened
between you two?

609
00:40:48,750 --> 00:40:50,863
Xiaohei wouldn't normally bite people.

610
00:40:51,500 --> 00:40:52,875
This is what happened.

611
00:40:53,167 --> 00:40:54,167
That day

612
00:40:54,731 --> 00:40:56,190
I was hiking on the grasslands

613
00:40:56,708 --> 00:40:58,105
planning to camp by the lake

614
00:40:58,708 --> 00:41:00,019
but unexpectedly

615
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:02,375
I encountered a pack of wolves.

616
00:41:03,792 --> 00:41:05,926
I tried to scare them off.

617
00:41:06,208 --> 00:41:08,000
But the alpha caught me off guard

618
00:41:08,000 --> 00:41:09,910
and charged at me, biting my hand.

619
00:41:10,870 --> 00:41:12,536
Just when I had given up hope,

620
00:41:12,561 --> 00:41:14,793
Xiaohei rushed out and saved me.

621
00:41:15,500 --> 00:41:16,785
It was Xiaohei.

622
00:41:17,458 --> 00:41:19,333
He fought with those wolves.

623
00:41:20,730 --> 00:41:21,750
After that,

624
00:41:23,208 --> 00:41:24,761
some herders arrived too.

625
00:41:25,292 --> 00:41:26,417
But

626
00:41:27,667 --> 00:41:30,660
I saw with my own eyes
as those wolves dragged Xiaohei away.

627
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:36,976
Only this dog tag was left behind.

628
00:41:49,958 --> 00:41:50,875
So...

629
00:41:52,496 --> 00:41:54,496
you didn't come here because you were lost.

630
00:41:55,945 --> 00:41:56,820
Right.

631
00:41:57,632 --> 00:41:58,667
I wasn't lost.

632
00:42:02,445 --> 00:42:05,000
Then what was all of this? You coming here?

633
00:42:05,083 --> 00:42:06,083
To compensate me?

634
00:42:06,083 --> 00:42:06,906
Amur.

635
00:42:08,208 --> 00:42:10,000
I did come because of Xiaohei

636
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:12,875
but now I truly love it here.

637
00:42:12,875 --> 00:42:14,625
I could even take Xiaohei's place
and stay with you.

638
00:42:14,625 --> 00:42:15,792
Let go.

639
00:42:15,917 --> 00:42:17,333
You could never replace him.

640
00:42:19,617 --> 00:42:20,542
Lei Zexin,

641
00:42:21,250 --> 00:42:22,542
in this world,

642
00:42:23,667 --> 00:42:25,625
no one can stay with anyone forever.

643
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:29,343
I can, I can stay with you forever.

644
00:42:29,958 --> 00:42:31,600
If I die,

645
00:42:31,625 --> 00:42:33,500
then bury me next to that meteorite.

646
00:42:33,828 --> 00:42:35,245
To stay with you forever.

647
00:42:43,921 --> 00:42:44,960
Just leave.

648
00:42:47,515 --> 00:42:49,007
You've wanted to leave for a while now.

649
00:42:51,023 --> 00:42:53,148
Now that you've said everything
you needed to.

650
00:42:55,393 --> 00:42:57,101
You can leave with no regrets.

651
00:43:00,667 --> 00:43:01,720
That's not what I meant.

652
00:43:01,745 --> 00:43:03,245
Don't say any more, Lei Zexin.

653
00:43:04,667 --> 00:43:05,917
Whether it was to repay a debt

654
00:43:06,750 --> 00:43:08,000
or to atone,

655
00:43:09,542 --> 00:43:12,542
you've done what you needed to do.

656
00:43:13,333 --> 00:43:14,333
Now

657
00:43:15,542 --> 00:43:17,125
it's time for you to leave.

658
00:43:53,417 --> 00:43:54,401
Amur.

659
00:43:58,000 --> 00:43:58,610
Mongke.

660
00:43:58,635 --> 00:43:59,333
Amur.

661
00:43:59,333 --> 00:44:01,225
Here, perfect timing.

662
00:44:01,250 --> 00:44:02,208
Have some morning tea.

663
00:44:02,208 --> 00:44:03,667
Oh, thanks.

664
00:44:03,792 --> 00:44:05,625
Hey, your invitation.

665
00:44:10,542 --> 00:44:13,458
(Wedding Invitation)

666
00:44:20,101 --> 00:44:22,089
She really can't stand being alone.

667
00:44:23,401 --> 00:44:24,901
Do you want to go or not?

668
00:44:25,250 --> 00:44:27,320
Hey, if you don't wanna go, just tell me.

669
00:44:27,625 --> 00:44:29,792
I'll let Auntie Yalin know.

670
00:44:31,542 --> 00:44:32,333
Mongke.

671
00:44:33,167 --> 00:44:33,875
Who's getting married?

672
00:44:33,875 --> 00:44:36,000
Hey, c'mon over, sit sit sit.

673
00:44:36,000 --> 00:44:37,226
Sit sit sit.

674
00:44:39,917 --> 00:44:41,171
Amur's mom.

675
00:44:41,840 --> 00:44:43,590
And his fourth stepdad.

676
00:44:45,089 --> 00:44:48,499
Oh, so he does have family.

677
00:44:49,878 --> 00:44:50,742
Yeah.

678
00:44:50,945 --> 00:44:52,083
See this guesthouse?

679
00:44:52,792 --> 00:44:54,377
His mom left it to him.

680
00:44:55,250 --> 00:44:56,708
But y'know

681
00:44:56,708 --> 00:44:58,750
she hasn't been back for many years.

682
00:45:00,375 --> 00:45:01,432
You should go now.

683
00:45:03,333 --> 00:45:04,167
Hey.

684
00:45:04,755 --> 00:45:07,464
I haven't even finished peeling this egg
and you're kicking me out?

685
00:45:09,458 --> 00:45:10,833
I was talking to Lei Zexin.

686
00:45:12,667 --> 00:45:15,167
After breakfast,
take the motorcycle out front and go.

687
00:45:17,987 --> 00:45:18,917
Amur.

688
00:45:19,417 --> 00:45:20,708
Why're you being like this?

689
00:45:20,917 --> 00:45:23,375
Hey, Lei Zexin's your most important guest.

690
00:45:23,625 --> 00:45:25,588
If he leaves, I'll be real sad, y'know.

691
00:45:33,791 --> 00:45:34,708
Amur.

692
00:45:41,260 --> 00:45:42,083
Mongke.

693
00:45:42,333 --> 00:45:45,208
Is Amur really not going to
his mom's wedding?

694
00:45:45,208 --> 00:45:46,875
Can you try to convince him?

695
00:45:47,292 --> 00:45:48,917
Nah, no point.

696
00:45:49,437 --> 00:45:53,187
He's just as stubborn as his mom.

697
00:45:53,489 --> 00:45:56,558
Hey, remember to send me a message
when you arrive.

698
00:45:56,583 --> 00:45:58,167
Don't make us worry.

699
00:45:58,167 --> 00:45:58,792
Okay.

700
00:45:58,792 --> 00:46:00,875
No problem, I will.

701
00:47:19,948 --> 00:47:20,958
<i>Amur.</i>

702
00:47:22,525 --> 00:47:23,760
I'm leaving.

703
00:47:24,112 --> 00:47:25,820
This journey to the grasslands

704
00:47:26,292 --> 00:47:27,667
has been complete.

705
00:47:29,058 --> 00:47:32,016
All that's left is to consider
a final resting place.

706
00:47:33,125 --> 00:47:35,917
Maybe back to Singapore.

707
00:47:37,458 --> 00:47:40,750
Amur, go see your mom.

708
00:47:41,458 --> 00:47:43,500
I've been praying to the Eternal Sky.

709
00:47:44,083 --> 00:47:48,167
Hoping that somewhere in this world
there would be someone who

710
00:47:48,502 --> 00:47:49,877
loves you more than I do.

711
00:47:51,749 --> 00:47:53,207
I think that person

712
00:47:53,833 --> 00:47:55,784
can only be her.

713
00:47:57,698 --> 00:47:58,708
Amur.

714
00:48:00,583 --> 00:48:01,792
Goodbye.

715
00:48:02,708 --> 00:48:04,500
Now I finally believe

716
00:48:05,083 --> 00:48:08,049
that meteorite traveling billions
of miles to reach this place.

717
00:48:09,453 --> 00:48:10,995
It was always

718
00:48:11,625 --> 00:48:13,042
its own choice.

719
00:49:20,583 --> 00:49:21,682
Amur.

720
00:49:31,890 --> 00:49:33,098
Are you alright?

721
00:49:34,708 --> 00:49:35,875
I...

722
00:49:37,458 --> 00:49:40,000
Son, don't be angry
with your mother anymore.

723
00:49:50,250 --> 00:49:51,542
My son.

724
00:49:52,432 --> 00:49:53,862
You've been through so much.

725
00:49:56,083 --> 00:49:57,292
It's... it's Mom's fault.

726
00:49:57,292 --> 00:49:58,909
Let Mom apologize to you, okay?

727
00:50:01,877 --> 00:50:02,833
You don't have to.

728
00:50:05,104 --> 00:50:08,000
Mongke said you're going to find someone
very important.

729
00:50:08,000 --> 00:50:09,833
Somewhere very far away?

730
00:50:13,120 --> 00:50:13,953
Singapore.

731
00:50:15,387 --> 00:50:17,846
Alright, go find him.

732
00:50:18,792 --> 00:50:19,750
If you have any difficulties...

733
00:50:19,750 --> 00:50:21,268
Don't worry, Mom.

734
00:50:23,208 --> 00:50:24,823
Passport and visa are all ready.

735
00:50:25,239 --> 00:50:26,239
I have everything I need.

736
00:50:30,140 --> 00:50:32,057
It's been so many years
since you called me Mom.

737
00:50:34,167 --> 00:50:35,125
Son.

738
00:50:35,792 --> 00:50:37,000
You've grown up.

739
00:50:37,641 --> 00:50:39,724
Go find the person you're looking for.

740
00:50:39,968 --> 00:50:42,502
No matter how far,
your mother supports you.

741
00:50:43,286 --> 00:50:44,203
Mom.

742
00:50:45,208 --> 00:50:46,250
I'm...

743
00:50:47,500 --> 00:50:50,042
sorry I couldn't make it
to your wedding.

744
00:50:50,042 --> 00:50:52,893
It's okay, it's okay, son,
Mom doesn't blame you.

745
00:50:53,833 --> 00:50:55,666
Mom, don't cry.

746
00:50:58,125 --> 00:50:59,517
It's nothing.

747
00:50:59,542 --> 00:51:02,917
These are tears of happiness.

748
00:51:11,393 --> 00:51:12,333
Amur.

749
00:51:13,083 --> 00:51:14,401
Ha ha ha ha ha.

750
00:51:15,812 --> 00:51:19,437
Oh man, you're finally gonna leave
the grasslands in your life!

751
00:51:19,462 --> 00:51:20,754
As your friend,

752
00:51:21,292 --> 00:51:22,625
I'm happy for ya.

753
00:51:22,922 --> 00:51:23,714
Remember.

754
00:51:24,667 --> 00:51:25,958
You gotta find Lei Zexin.

755
00:51:27,875 --> 00:51:29,250
How did you know

756
00:51:29,833 --> 00:51:31,333
I'd definitely go find Lei Zexin?

757
00:51:31,333 --> 00:51:32,708
Ha ha ha.

758
00:51:33,708 --> 00:51:35,375
Hey, between friends,

759
00:51:35,375 --> 00:51:36,885
there ain't no secrets.

760
00:51:39,713 --> 00:51:40,542
Mongke.

761
00:51:40,542 --> 00:51:41,333
Mm?

762
00:51:42,333 --> 00:51:43,625
I'll be back.

763
00:51:44,625 --> 00:51:45,958
I know that, of course.

764
00:51:45,958 --> 00:51:48,000
The person who can make you
leave the grasslands

765
00:51:48,000 --> 00:51:49,667
will definitely bring you back too.

766
00:51:55,833 --> 00:51:56,625
I'm going.

767
00:51:57,083 --> 00:51:57,875
Go on.

768
00:51:59,473 --> 00:52:00,307
Good luck.

769
00:52:25,401 --> 00:52:27,682
(Xiaohei)

770
00:52:39,192 --> 00:52:40,026
Hello?

771
00:52:40,824 --> 00:52:42,455
<i>Is this Mr. Amur?</i>

772
00:52:43,835 --> 00:52:45,252
Oh, yes it is.

773
00:52:45,554 --> 00:52:46,512
Who is this?

774
00:52:47,190 --> 00:52:48,333
<i>My name is Du Bianyi.</i>

775
00:52:48,333 --> 00:52:50,182
<i>I'm Lei Zexin's attending physician.</i>

776
00:52:51,247 --> 00:52:53,081
What happened to Lei Zexin?

777
00:52:53,106 --> 00:52:55,606
<i>He left the hospital a week ago.</i>

778
00:52:55,958 --> 00:52:58,167
<i>He has no family members on record.</i>

779
00:52:58,167 --> 00:53:01,042
<i>So in his file, he only listed
your name and phone number.</i>

780
00:53:03,195 --> 00:53:04,320
What's his condition?

781
00:53:04,345 --> 00:53:07,096
<i>He has Cerebral Vascular Malformation.</i>

782
00:53:07,584 --> 00:53:09,667
<i>Commonly known as a brain aneurysm.</i>

783
00:53:10,333 --> 00:53:12,750
<i>He really should have surgery immediately.</i>

784
00:53:13,167 --> 00:53:15,208
<i>Of course, surgery has its risks</i>

785
00:53:15,208 --> 00:53:17,500
<i>and the patient could have a brain
hemorrhage at any time.</i>

786
00:53:17,729 --> 00:53:20,291
<i>So the operation is highly risky.</i>

787
00:53:23,402 --> 00:53:25,861
<i>I first admitted Lei Zexin
a year and a half ago</i>

788
00:53:25,886 --> 00:53:28,177
<i>but he only left a note in his room</i>

789
00:53:29,208 --> 00:53:32,750
<i>saying "I want to spend the rest
of my life on natural time"</i>

790
00:53:32,792 --> 00:53:34,083
<i>and then he disappeared.</i>

791
00:53:35,122 --> 00:53:36,747
Driver, driver!

792
00:53:36,919 --> 00:53:37,791
Stop the car.

793
00:53:37,987 --> 00:53:39,667
<i>Recently he came back once.</i>

794
00:53:39,708 --> 00:53:41,125
<i>We insisted he have surgery</i>

795
00:53:41,125 --> 00:53:42,850
<i>but he left the hospital again.</i>

796
00:53:42,875 --> 00:53:46,667
<i>So we're hoping to find him through you.</i>

797
00:53:52,315 --> 00:53:53,648
Standing here...

798
00:53:54,203 --> 00:53:56,786
It's as if I'm standing
at the center of the world.

799
00:53:59,167 --> 00:54:00,125
Amur.

800
00:54:01,125 --> 00:54:01,958
Have you

801
00:54:02,625 --> 00:54:04,083
ever felt that way?

802
00:54:11,831 --> 00:54:12,997
If life...

803
00:54:13,542 --> 00:54:14,833
had only one day left,

804
00:54:15,750 --> 00:54:17,083
how would I spend it?

805
00:54:20,417 --> 00:54:21,500
Just like

806
00:54:22,208 --> 00:54:23,542
how I'm spending it right now.

807
00:54:35,104 --> 00:54:36,088
Lei Zexin.

808
00:54:45,786 --> 00:54:46,578
Lei Zexin.

809
00:54:52,215 --> 00:54:53,125
Lei Zexin.

810
00:54:58,778 --> 00:54:59,737
Lei Zexin.

811
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:01,489
Lei Zexin.

812
00:55:02,917 --> 00:55:04,426
Lei Zexin.

813
00:55:05,167 --> 00:55:06,309
Lei Zexin.

814
00:55:09,417 --> 00:55:10,692
Lei Zexin.

815
00:55:13,526 --> 00:55:14,317
Amur.

816
00:55:16,208 --> 00:55:17,167
You think,

817
00:55:17,917 --> 00:55:19,667
maybe he never even came here?

818
00:55:20,927 --> 00:55:22,927
With his body in such bad shape,

819
00:55:22,952 --> 00:55:24,786
he might not have even made it here.

820
00:55:26,125 --> 00:55:28,583
Ah, why'd I have to say that.

821
00:55:31,339 --> 00:55:32,997
He will come back here.

822
00:55:57,013 --> 00:55:58,763
I saw a marker over there.

823
00:55:59,875 --> 00:56:01,833
Looks like it was set up for Xiaohei.

824
00:56:08,085 --> 00:56:08,877
Look.

825
00:56:10,781 --> 00:56:13,804
(Amur's guest)

826
00:56:13,879 --> 00:56:14,879
It's him.

827
00:56:16,526 --> 00:56:17,609
He came back.

828
00:56:20,500 --> 00:56:22,824
He must be the one
who put this up for Xiaohei.

829
00:56:29,750 --> 00:56:30,875
Hey Amur.

830
00:56:30,900 --> 00:56:32,150
Amur, don't do that.

831
00:56:32,175 --> 00:56:33,892
You'll hurt your hands, Amur.

832
00:56:33,917 --> 00:56:34,833
He's right here.

833
00:56:34,833 --> 00:56:35,458
Amur.

834
00:56:35,458 --> 00:56:36,708
He must have come back..

835
00:56:36,875 --> 00:56:37,583
It must be him.

836
00:56:37,583 --> 00:56:38,058
Amur.

837
00:56:38,083 --> 00:56:39,125
He's right here.

838
00:56:39,125 --> 00:56:40,292
Stop it, Amur.

839
00:56:40,542 --> 00:56:42,660
Oh, Amur.

840
00:56:44,505 --> 00:56:46,464
He might not have come at all.

841
00:56:48,854 --> 00:56:50,854
What are you doing? Why are you like this?

842
00:56:54,624 --> 00:56:55,541
He wouldn't.

843
00:56:56,464 --> 00:56:58,381
Xiaohei gave his life to save him.

844
00:56:58,406 --> 00:56:59,869
He'll come back for me.

845
00:57:23,583 --> 00:57:24,458
Amur.

846
00:57:33,292 --> 00:57:34,125
Amur.

847
00:57:46,820 --> 00:57:48,862
I still want to spend the rest of my life

848
00:57:49,669 --> 00:57:51,211
on natural time...

849
00:57:52,417 --> 00:57:53,750
but, Amur,

850
00:57:55,417 --> 00:57:57,273
I need to be with you.
